  "ingredients": [
    "3 pounds potatoes, thinly sliced",
    "0.5 onion, thinly sliced",
    "9 tablespoons all-purpose flour, divided",
    "6 tablespoons butter, diced and divided",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "3 cups whole milk, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Grease a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/I5NX5W-kIL9_KLHiA_Pj9HD5G5Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240290-moms-scalloped-potatoes-DDMFS-Step-01-fbbb2fd8b8dc4d3b908439658f83c296.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240290/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange about ⅓ potato slices in the bottom of the prepared baking dish; top with about ⅓ onion slices. Sprinkle 3 tablespoons flour over potato and onion layer; place 2 tablespoons cubed butter on top. Season layer with salt and black pepper. Repeat layering twice more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yxqLHE8pMtrOyBAHdWTUsXVCYnM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240290-MomsScallopedPotatoes-MFS-Step3-778887f05d874de297d8cdd05a40d51c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240290/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat milk in a saucepan over medium-low heat until warm. Pour enough warm milk over mixture in the baking dish until top of the liquid is level with the final layer of potatoes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xEkHNfVAgOaOvU3JR8FiBLrgqY0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240290-MomsScallopedPotatoes-MFS-Step4-d283fa37c5964afeb47e95a64945f1e3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240290/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until potatoes are tender and sauce is bubbling with a golden brown crust, 45 to 60 minutes. Place a baking sheet underneath the baking dish to catch any drips; the sauce may bubble up over the sides. Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4Etd_GTsUQPvXG0B-nVVBCGZ7fE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240290-moms-scalloped-potatoes-DDMFS-4x3-6921e40df71440008124327b519004f8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240290/step_04.webp"
    }
  ],
